    {
      "id": "PR2JeJuD4luz2k6GPo7PI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1352.3382257686085,
      "y": 3254.2361854877736,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#475569",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bZ8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1410617763,
      "version": 12,
      "versionNonce": 1265889411,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794923517929,
      "created": 1794923517929,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Reliable job dispatch and recovery — durable queue, reclaim stale leases, guarantee terminal status.\n• Pay-as-you-go billing — reserve before work; settle on success; release funds on failure.\n• Provider retries — bounded backoff for transient errors; record final failures.\n• Redis caching — cache-aside catalog reads; TTL expiry; invalidate on edits.\n• Private Supabase Storage — private bucket, ownership checks, short-lived signed URLs.\n• Latency and recovery metrics — API p95, queue age, provider duration, failures, lease recovery.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Reliable job dispatch and recovery — durable queue, reclaim stale leases, guarantee terminal status.\n• Pay-as-you-go billing — reserve before work; settle on success; release funds on failure.\n• Provider retries — bounded backoff for transient errors; record final failures.\n• Redis caching — cache-aside catalog reads; TTL expiry; invalidate on edits.\n• Private Supabase Storage — private bucket, ownership checks, short-lived signed URLs.\n• Latency and recovery metrics — API p95, queue age, provider duration, failures, lease recovery.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "startBinding": null,
      "endBinding": null
    },
