      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Validate its own model settings.\n• Insert queued jobs and expose job status.\n• Worker claims jobs and calls model providers.\n• Retry failures and publish the outcome.",
